    {
      "key": "td215036a74cc618c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">2. Choose Position Sizes Carefully</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">2。仔細選擇頭寸規模</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t8ca7b4161b4c5abc",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Position sizing helps determine how much market exposure to take based on the amount you are prepared to risk.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">頭寸規模有助於根據您準備承擔風險的金額確定承擔多少市場風險。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf6d39a23e9061f8f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">3. Understand Stop-Loss Orders</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">3。瞭解止損單</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t5d98ecba60869096",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">However, stop-loss orders do not guarantee the exact closing price. During periods of high volatility or market gaps, execution may occur at a different price.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">但是，止損單並不保證確切的平倉價格。在市場劇烈波動或出現跳空時，可能會以不同的價格成交。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tea5357fadd0c76ae",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">4. Avoid Using Maximum Available Leverage</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">4。避免使用最大可用槓桿</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t03f54a630055576f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Beginners should first understand how margin works and practise managing positions before considering higher levels of exposure.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">初學者應首先了解保證金的運作方式並練習管理倉位，然後再考慮更高的風險水平。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t803e665539c09c9b",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">5. Monitor Open Positions Regularly</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">5。定期監控未平倉頭寸</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tbe6ea23800b1304c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Should Beginners Know Before Using Forex Leverage in the UAE?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">初學者在阿聯酋使用外匯槓桿之前應該瞭解什麼？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t474297a35607aaa5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">People interested in </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">forex trading UAE</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> should understand that trading conditions can vary depending on the provider, financial instrument, account type, and applicable regulatory jurisdiction.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">對</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">阿聯酋外匯交易</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">感興趣的人應了解，交易條件可能因提供商、金融工具、帳戶類型以及適用的監管轄區而異。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t42631ad32e368429",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Understand margin requirements:</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> Check how much margin is needed to open and maintain a position.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">瞭解保證金要求：</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">檢查開倉和維持倉位需要多少保證金。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t42ae1f09a6fbaedf",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Compare trading costs:</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> Review spreads, commissions, overnight financing, and other charges.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">比較交易成本：</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">審查點差、佣金、隔夜融資和其他費用。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9e590079649f3cef",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Practise before trading live:</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> A demo account can help beginners understand order placement, platform functions, and how leveraged positions behave without risking real money.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">實時交易前練習：</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">模擬賬戶可以幫助初學者瞭解訂單下達、平臺功能以及槓桿頭寸的行為方式，而無需冒真金白銀的風險。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "te195c75979654703",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Frequently Asked Questions About Leverage in Forex Trading</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">有關外匯交易槓桿的常見問題</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tbd6bae59f958e12f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">2. Is high leverage better for forex trading?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">2。高槓桿是否更適合外匯交易？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "te37c37c0caaa1b74",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">3. Can beginners use leverage in forex trading?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">3。初學者可以在外匯交易中使用槓桿嗎？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t598efccf06a2d2c1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Beginners can access leveraged trading where permitted and subject to account eligibility. However, they should first understand margin, position sizing, and potential losses. Practising with a demo account can help build familiarity before considering live trading.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">初學者可以在允許且符合賬戶資格的情況下進行槓桿交易。然而，他們應該首先了解保證金、頭寸規模和潛在損失。使用模擬賬戶進行練習有助於在考慮進行實時交易之前建立熟悉度。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t453fec687a8ddea0",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">4. What happens when a forex trade reaches a margin call?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">4。當外匯交易達到追加保證金時會發生什麼？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "te4a27035117b7725",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A margin call may occur when account equity falls below a provider's required margin threshold. Depending on the provider's policies, traders may need to reduce exposure or add funds. Open positions may also be closed automatically.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">當賬戶淨值低於提供商要求的保證金閾值時，可能會發生追加保證金通知。根據提供商的政策，交易者可能需要減少風險或增加資金。未平倉頭寸也可能會自動平倉。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t7537ba82c0b6a0b0",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">6. What is the difference between leverage and margin?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">6。槓桿和保證金有什麼區別？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t406b6113e6fbc047",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Leverage determines how large a position can be relative to the required capital. Margin is the amount of money required to open and maintain that position.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">槓桿決定頭寸相對於所需資本的大小。保證金是開立和維持該倉位所需的金額。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t65c055d779accfb9",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Risk Warning: Forex and CFD trading involve significant risks and may not be suitable for every investor. Leverage can magnify both profits and losses, and you may lose some or all of your invested capital. Review the applicable product disclosures, account terms, and regulatory information before trading. This article is for educational purposes only and does not constitute financial or investment advice.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">風險警告：外匯和差價合約交易涉及重大風險，可能並不適合每個投資者。槓桿可以放大利潤和損失，您可能會損失部分或全部投資資金。交易前檢視適用的產品披露、賬戶條款和監管資訊。本文僅用於教育目的，不構成財務或投資建議。</span>"
    },
