    {
      "key": "t7359dff63b50700c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Unlike buying shares in a company, <span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">forex trading</span> involves comparing the value of one currency against another. Currencies are traded in pairs, and their prices change according to economic conditions, market demand and international developments.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">與購買公司股票不同，<span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">外匯交易</span>涉及比較一種貨幣與另一種貨幣的價值。貨幣成對交易，其價格根據經濟狀況、市場需求和國際發展而變化。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tb7e3ef5f084ae259",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Some commonly followed currency pairs include:</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">一些常見的貨幣對包括：</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t475611aa25e8e10e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">USD/CHF – US Dollar and Swiss Franc</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">USD/CHF – 美元和瑞士法郎</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t7ac6be4b41c1306f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Understanding these differences is a useful starting point before exploring online forex trading in Abu Dhabi.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">在探索阿布扎比線上外匯交易之前，瞭解這些差異是一個有用的起點。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t93c4c7067d7fe1c0",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Although the UAE Dirham is pegged to the US Dollar, international economic developments can still <span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">influence</span> other currency pairs followed by traders in Abu Dhabi.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">儘管阿聯酋迪拉姆與美元掛鉤，但國際經濟發展仍然可以<span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">影響</span>阿布扎比交易者關注的其他貨幣對。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta16dc30b24bf5169",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">3. Learn the Difference Between Major, Minor and Exotic Currency Pairs</span>",
