        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">3。瞭解主要、次要和奇異貨幣對之間的區別</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t6a047aa8166539c4",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Minor Currency Pairs:</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> These involve major currencies but do not include the US Dollar. Examples include EUR/GBP, EUR/CHF and GBP/JPY.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">次要貨幣對：</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">這些貨幣對涉及主要貨幣，但不包括美元。例如歐元/英鎊、歐元/瑞士法郎和英鎊/日元。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t01a0ab19450aeaa7",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">4. Understand Spreads, Pips and Trading Costs</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">4. 了解點差、點和交易成本</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0c2fd98ff1ddc359",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Three terms you should understand are pips, spreads and commissions.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">您應該瞭解的三個術語是點、點差和佣金。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tb177b976cc09ef1a",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is a Pip?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什麼是點？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tdf0b1b4d1d2f0ee5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A pip is a standard measurement used to describe a change in the exchange rate of a currency pair.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">點是用於描述貨幣對匯率變化的標準衡量標準。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9455856035210b82",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">For most currency pairs, one pip represents a movement in the fourth decimal place. For example, if EUR/USD moves from 1.1050 to 1.1051, that is generally a one-pip movement.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">對於大多數貨幣對，一個點代表小數點後第四位的變動。例如，如果歐元/美元從 1.1050 變動至 1.1051，這通常是一個點的變動。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t437f87b211db3622",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is a Spread?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什麼是點差？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t853c0658c050bd4a",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">For example, if a currency pair has a buying price of 1.1052 and a selling price of 1.1050, the difference is two pips.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">例如，如果貨幣對的買入價為 1.1052，賣出價為 1.1050，則差價為 二 點。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t8fc2a3ca3a75edc6",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A wider spread can increase the cost of entering and exiting a position.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">較大的點差會增加建倉和平倉的成本。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t4c17faebd8f6fc69",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Are There Additional Trading Charges?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">是否有額外的交易費用？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t6c8e2d71beb9d5e3",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Overnight financing or swap charges</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">隔夜融資或掉期費用</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0e5f1335c94f656b",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Currency conversion charges</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">貨幣兌換費用</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t8d9711044b7ef4fc",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Deposit and withdrawal fees</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">存款和取款費用</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tefbf7901ca4edee7",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Before opening an account, review the complete fee structure rather than comparing spreads alone.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">在開戶之前，請檢視完整的費用結構，而不是單獨比較點差。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta967030c7381c216",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">5. Understand Leverage and Margin Before Opening a Trade</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">5。開倉前瞭解槓桿和保證金</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t00f13d4127c0cfcb",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Leverage is one of the most important concepts to understand before starting <span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">forex trading in Abu Dhabi</span>.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">槓桿是<span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">在阿布扎比開始外匯交易</span>之前需要了解的最重要的概念之一。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t8aa5fe5dec6eed1b",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Margin is the amount required to maintain an open trading position. If the available account equity falls below certain levels, the trading provider may issue a margin call or automatically close positions according to its terms.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">保證金是維持未平倉交易頭寸所需的金額。如果可用賬戶淨值低於一定水平，交易提供商可能會根據其條款發出追加保證金通知或自動平倉。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t2a9384f49095e16e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Live market price monitoring</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">實時市場價格監控</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t6db1c2104d41ac9a",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Multiple chart timeframes</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">多個圖表時間範圍</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t31a41efad89740bc",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Desktop, mobile and web access</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-should-you-know-before-starting-forex-trading-in-abu-dhabi"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">桌面、移動和網路訪問</span>"
    }
  ]
}
